# Apps the gateway dashboard is allowed to restart. Root-owned: the dashboard can only
# restart what is listed here, so nothing else on the server can be touched through it.
#
# One per line:   <id>  systemd  <unit>.service
#                 <id>  docker   <container name>
# Then pick the id as "Restart target" in the project's Advanced settings.
#
# prajna-frontend      systemd  prajna-frontend.service
# meeting-transcriber  systemd  meeting-transcriber.service
# smart-finder         docker   smart-finder
